Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.24,0:00:03.99,Note,0,0,0,0,,（忆往昔）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.01,0:00:06.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我抓超自然生物 要在食物链顶端的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring me creatures. Aim high on the food chain.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.71,0:00:08.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论我们抓到什么 最后都送到这来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever we bag… ends up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.66,0:00:10.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在这折磨他们 审问他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's where he tortures them, interrogates them …
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.58,0:00:12.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真的就不知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't really know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.25,0:00:14.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不是你的雇员 - 你们当然是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We ain't your employees. - Of course you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.42,0:00:17.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,礼物包里是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's in the gift bag?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.60,0:00:19.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是你 - 不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You are. - Not possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.09,0:00:20.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的遗骸并没有藏得那么好\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't hide your bones as well as you should have.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.13,0:00:30.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是谁 这个叫夏娃的婊子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is she, this Eve bitch?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.48,0:00:33.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们所有人的母亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}The mother of all of us,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.07,0:00:35.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是你们所有人的末日\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the end of all of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.22,0:00:39.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,凤凰的灰烬可以烧掉万物之母\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ashes of a phoenix can burn the mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.11,0:00:40.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,1861年\N{\fnArial\fs30}"1861,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.41,0:00:42.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,桑勒斯 怀俄明州\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Sunrise, wyoming.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.13,0:00:43.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天枪杀了一只凤凰\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Gun killed a phoenix today.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.85,0:00:46.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,留下一堆阴燃的灰烬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Left a pile of smoldering ash."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.73,0:00:48.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谁的枪 - 科尔特的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Whose gun? - CoIt's.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.12,0:00:49.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们穿越回到过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We hop back in time,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.23,0:00:50.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到萨穆埃尔·科尔特\N{\fnArial\fs30}we join up with Samuel Colt,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.40,0:00:51.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们猎杀那只凤凰\N{\fnArial\fs30}We hunt the phoenix,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.54,0:00:53.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后带上灰烬回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then haul its ashes back home.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.11,0:01:02.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那是我想的那东西吗 - 凤凰的灰烬\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is that what I think it is? - Ashes of a phoenix.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.03,0:01:03.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道这意味着什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what this means?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.13,0:01:04.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要和她开战了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We take the fight to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.23,0:01:07.14,Note,0,0,0,0,,（如今）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.99,0:01:14.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是认真的 没开玩笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm serious. I'm serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.19,0:01:16.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,那真的太宰人了 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was way overpriced, dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.56,0:01:19.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我家乡 啤酒就三块钱一瓶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back where I'm from, okay, it was like $3 a beer.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.41,0:01:21.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 那下次我请客\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Then, I'm buying next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.08,0:01:23.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没说谎 真的没开玩笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not even lying. I'm not even joking at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.57,0:01:24.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.00,0:01:26.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,天使下凡了啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heaven must be missing an angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.59,0:01:39.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想她喜欢我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think she likes me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.82,0:01:44.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 自恋狂 走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, Fabio. Let's … let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.97,0:02:02.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧 小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you okay, miss?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.45,0:02:04.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.82,0:02:07.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 那是血吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, is … is that blood?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.39,0:02:11.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 我想是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I suppose it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.71,0:02:13.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure you're all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.68,0:02:32.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, what the hell?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.69,0:02:34.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我送给他了一份礼物\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gave him a gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.63,0:02:38.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 咱们走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, man. Let's get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.94,0:03:22.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,[邪恶力量 第6季第19集]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.93,0:03:49.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 你怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. How you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.11,0:03:52.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,五发子弹 就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five shells … that's how I'm doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.03,0:03:55.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.36,0:03:57.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,比起上周 这已经算不错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a hell of a lot more than we had last week.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.73,0:03:59.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.71,0:04:00.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meaning?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.81,0:04:04.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是我刚才出了个小意外\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meaning I just had myself a little mishap a few minutes ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.02,0:04:05.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有 看\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, uh … well, here, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.38,0:04:14.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,这东西应该能烧死夏娃\N{\fnArial\fs30}This stuff is supposed to burn the bejesus out of Eve.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.68,0:04:16.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,可我涂上它屁感觉都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't even give me a sunburn.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.15,0:04:18.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,传说应该有用的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The lore says it works.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.02,0:04:19.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也会说是「传说」\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's always reliable.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.85,0:04:21.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许它就像…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you know what? M-maybe it's like …
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.35,0:04:24.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许就像铁或者银\N{\fnArial\fs30}maybe it's like iron or silver, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.41,0:04:25.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,伤害他们 不会伤害我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurts them and not us?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.73,0:04:27.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能吧 但倒是对我们很有好处\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe, but a fat lot of good it does us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.94,0:04:29.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到我们找到那个婊子\N{\fnArial\fs30}until we find the bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.22,0:04:30.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在找 但是我想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm looking, but I'm thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.91,0:04:32.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能你是时候来次召唤了\N{\fnArial\fs30}maybe it's time you made a call.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.97,0:04:36.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么每次都是我召唤呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why's it always got to be me that makes the call, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.92,0:04:38.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,小卡又不是我的跟屁虫\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not like Cass lives in my ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.78,0:04:40.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,那家伙忙着呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}The dude's busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.02,0:04:42.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,小卡 别跟我屁股后头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass, get out of my ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.90,0:04:44.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从没在你的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was never in your …
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.13,0:04:49.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们找夏娃的工作有什么进展了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you made any progress in locating Eve?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.58,0:04:52.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实 我们正想问你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we were gonna ask you about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.15,0:04:54.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我找过 但是她能躲开我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've looked, but she's hidden from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.88,0:04:56.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,她躲掉了所有的天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's hidden from all angels.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.55,0:04:58.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.99,0:05:02.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道 其实我们就需要一个内应\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, what we really need is an inside man.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.50,0:05:03.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.16,0:05:05.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个有爪子有同情心的家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something with claws and sympathy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.39,0:05:08.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,是说一个友好的怪物吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like a friendly monster?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.94,0:05:10.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在这样的越来越少了 你说呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those are in short supply these days, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.51,0:05:12.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 但是我们见过一两个 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure, but we've met one or two, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.49,0:05:14.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.29,0:05:18.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我们能找到一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, maybe we can find one.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.24,0:05:38.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,丽诺尔 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lenore. Wait. Wait. Wait. Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.16,0:05:40.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 丽诺尔 停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hey. Lenore, stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.76,0:05:44.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我们很高兴见到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, we're happy you're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.13,0:05:47.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫丽诺尔 我不会伤害你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name's Lenore. I'm not gonna hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.22,0:05:53.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,很久没见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.50,0:05:55.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还记得我们吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You remember us?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.75,0:05:57.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.72,0:05:59.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的猎人朋友差点杀了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your hunter friend almost killed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.67,0:06:01.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 如果这能让你舒服些\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, if it makes you feel any better,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.52,0:06:03.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,他后来变成了吸血鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}uh, he turned into a vampire,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.50,0:06:05.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后我砍掉了他的头\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I chopped his head off.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.23,0:06:08.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,用铁丝网 超赞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, with razor wire. Wicked.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.63,0:06:10.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,那可真不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's something.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.02,0:06:13.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.40,0:06:14.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为什么在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why am I here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.64,0:06:16.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, um…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.82,0:06:18.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,小卡带你来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.21,0:06:20.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是我们的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's our friend,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.29,0:06:23.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要跟你谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we need to talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.31,0:06:25.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于夏娃\N{\fnArial\fs30}about Eve.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.78,0:06:28.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,夏娃吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eve?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.75,0:06:31.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于夏娃我没什么好说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have nothing to say about Eve.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.47,0:06:32.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.01,0:06:35.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正努力躲着她 相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm trying to stay away from her. Believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.10,0:06:38.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的巢在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's your nest?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.57,0:06:40.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.09,0:06:42.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我抗拒不了了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I couldn't fight it anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.37,0:06:45.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我们脑子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's her voice…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.92,0:06:47.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直有她的声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}in our heads…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.73,0:06:50.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,她对我们做出的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}what it does to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.75,0:06:53.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以他们离开了 又开始杀戮\N{\fnArial\fs30}So they left, started killing again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.66,0:06:54.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}But not you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.94,0:06:56.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,别表现的那么赞赏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't look so impressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.86,0:06:58.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我躲在一个地下室\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was hiding in a basement.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.39,0:07:00.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,那可不怎么舒服\N{\fnArial\fs30}… not exactly club med.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.56,0:07:05.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们不知道 不屈服是多么困难\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know how hard it is not to give in.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.81,0:07:07.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有人都屈服了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone gives in.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.95,0:07:11.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 你这个双向通灵的能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, so, this psychic two-way you got going,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.77,0:07:13.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,这意味着你知道妖他妈在哪吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}does that mean you know where mom's camped out?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.57,0:07:14.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你拿我寻开心呢吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got to be kidding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.94,0:07:17.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要我告诉你她在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want me to tell you where she is?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.21,0:07:20.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道她可能现在就在听我们说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do know she could be listening to us right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.25,0:07:22.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我差不多就是个摄像机了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I might as well be a video camera.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.57,0:07:24.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们怎么想的啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.31,0:07:27.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么我们就不能奇袭了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, we don't have the element of surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.01,0:07:28.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还是要去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're still going in.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.34,0:07:29.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.65,0:07:30.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我帮不了你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.68,0:07:31.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮不了还是不想帮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't or won't?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.15,0:07:34.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,很明显\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, it's clear as day,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.82,0:07:36.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还是在乎的\N{\fnArial\fs30}you still give a crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.81,0:07:38.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不想杀戮\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't want to kill,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.67,0:07:41.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也不想让整个星球都完蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you don't want this whole planet dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.61,0:07:46.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真以为你能阻止她吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You actually believe you can stop her?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.53,0:07:47.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,就告诉我们她在哪吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just tell us where she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.69,0:07:53.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,俄勒冈州 格兰茨帕斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grants Pass, Oregon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.79,0:07:55.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在她知道你们要去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now she knows you're coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.67,0:07:56.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们去看看吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, let's go see.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.86,0:07:58.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.16,0:08:01.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉你们不是出于好心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't tell you this out of the goodness of my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.69,0:08:02.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要点回报\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need something.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.83,0:08:04.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.07,0:08:08.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.38,0:08:09.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,丽诺尔 听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lenore, look…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.94,0:08:11.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会把你锁起来 直到事情结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll lock you down till this whole thing is over, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.64,0:08:13.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,证人保护 你很安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}Witness protection. You'll be safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.02,0:08:16.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不明白 不是关于我的安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't get it. It's not about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.15,0:08:17.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才是危险人物\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.87,0:08:19.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我总是能听到她的声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hear her voice all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.39,0:08:20.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟其他人不一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not like the rest of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.62,0:08:23.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟他们一模一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm exactly like them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.59,0:08:25.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我吸血了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I fed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.93,0:08:27.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我无法控制\N{\fnArial\fs30}I couldn't help it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.74,0:08:30.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,那女孩最多十六岁 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}The girl couldn't have been more than 16, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.76,0:08:33.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,有第一次就有第二次\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll do it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.82,0:08:35.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我停不下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.92,0:08:37.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我再也无法自制了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.89,0:08:39.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须杀了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.59,0:08:40.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 求你 - 丽诺尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Please. - Lenore…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.56,0:08:56.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们该行动了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We needed to move this along.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.87,0:09:04.20,Note,0,0,0,0,,（俄勒冈州 格兰茨帕斯）
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.45,0:09:12.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还以为会是遍地僵尸呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I was expecting more "Zombieland, "
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.46,0:09:15.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里却一派祥和嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}less "Pleasantville."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.05,0:09:17.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,表面平静不代表真的平静\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just because it looks quiet don't mean it is,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.55,0:09:19.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,特别是她还知道我们要来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}especially if she's got a clue we're coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.70,0:09:21.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果她在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, if she is here,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.44,0:09:23.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少我们队还有个强力小翅膀\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm glad we got Smitey McSmiterton on our squad.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.71,0:09:26.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我们从哪开始找\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Where do we start?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.21,0:09:28.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要一台电脑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna need a computer.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.10,0:09:36.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.96,0:09:38.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我总算进到警方资料库了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I finally got the police database,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.49,0:09:40.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,这玩意儿真不好使\N{\fnArial\fs30}no thanks to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.76,0:09:42.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要的是「电脑」\N{\fnArial\fs30}I asked for a computer.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.13,0:09:43.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是电脑\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is a computer.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.22,0:09:45.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,才不是 电脑是有按键的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, a computer has buttons.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.52,0:09:48.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 还要点别的吗 - 不用 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can I get you anything else? - No, we're good. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.35,0:09:48.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,有发现吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.94,0:09:51.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,小打小闹 没什么怪事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, nickel-and-dime stuff, nothing weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.02,0:09:53.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,基本上是撞南墙了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Basically, dead end.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.39,0:09:56.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得那个吸血鬼撒谎了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think vampira was lying?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.50,0:09:59.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去镇上搜搜 一下就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll search the town. Give me a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.87,0:10:06.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,小卡 我们还能看到你哟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass, we can still see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.91,0:10:08.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 我还在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'm still here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.91,0:10:10.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 又不用你等我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, well, you don't have to wait on us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.04,0:10:16.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在看上去像是在拉屎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, now it just looks like you're pooping.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.09,0:10:20.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有点不对劲 - 你卡住了啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Something's wrong. - What, are you stuck?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.36,0:10:21.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,是受阻了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm blocked.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.58,0:10:26.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有法力了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm powerless.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.12,0:10:27.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你开玩笑吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're joking.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.43,0:10:30.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,这镇上的什么东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something in this town is, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.35,0:10:31.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,在影响我\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's affecting me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.64,0:10:33.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想应该是夏娃\N{\fnArial\fs30}I assume it's Eve.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.44,0:10:35.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 妖他妈让你软了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, wait. Mom's making you limp?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.06,0:10:37.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Figuratively, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.64,0:10:39.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么会 - 不知道 但她做到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How? - I don't know, but she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.70,0:10:41.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了 你失去法力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, well, that's great, 'cause without your power,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.43,0:10:43.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,基本上就是个穿着大衣的小宝宝\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're basically just a baby in a trench coat.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.22,0:10:51.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得你伤到人家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you hurt his feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.58,0:10:55.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我好像查到了点东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got something here, maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.03,0:10:56.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,得到联邦资料库里才能找到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Had to go Federal to get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.76,0:10:59.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨晚地方办事处给疾控中心打了通电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call went out from the Local Office to the C.D.C. Last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.62,0:11:00.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}About what?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.90,0:11:03.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯勒文医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}A Dr. Silver…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.49,0:11:06.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,电话上报了一种他诊断不出来的疾病\N{\fnArial\fs30}called in an illness he couldn't identify.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.26,0:11:09.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,病人是二十五岁的非裔美国人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Patient's a 25-year-old African-American.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.61,0:11:12.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,名叫艾德·博莱斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}named Ed Bright.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.50,0:11:16.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么好查的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's not much to go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.48,0:11:17.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我们唯一的线索了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's our only lead, so…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.95,0:11:19.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,要饭的就别嫌饭馊了 我懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}So beggars can't be choosers. Right. I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.95,0:11:21.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 吃完走人吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, well, let's finish up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.55,0:11:24.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,打扰下 斯勒文医生在吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me. Hi. Uh, I-is Dr. Silver in today?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.26,0:11:26.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我朋友病得很重\N{\fnArial\fs30}My friend is very sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.79,0:11:32.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有很疼的灼烧感\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a, uh… painful burning sensation.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.48,0:11:35.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不在 抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, well, he's out. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.30,0:11:36.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道他在哪吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you happen to know where he is?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.77,0:11:38.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还没打电话来呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}He hasn't called in.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.60,0:11:41.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还是自己找点药膏涂吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You might want to find yourself some ointment.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.08,0:11:46.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪有医生打电话给疾控中心\N{\fnArial\fs30}What kind of doctor calls the C.D.C.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.00,0:11:49.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,第二天却开小差了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then goes awol the very next day?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.48,0:11:52.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们去看看吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's have a look, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.39,0:12:12.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,开锁要很长时间吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this gonna take a long time?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.78,0:12:19.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.50,0:12:39.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,是那个病人 艾德·博莱斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the patient, Ed Bright.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.77,0:12:41.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪有医生打电话给疾控中心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, what kind of doctor calls the C.D.C.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.73,0:12:43.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后把黏糊糊的尸体藏在自己的棚子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then stashes the gooey corpse in his shed?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.24,0:12:46.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不明白到底怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't understand what's happening here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.53,0:12:49.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我倒是知道该怎么处理尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I know one thing about the body,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.62,0:12:52.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要煤油\N{\fnArial\fs30}we need some kerosene.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.07,0:12:58.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,看 斯勒文医生 他老婆和两个儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here. Dr. Silver. Wife, two sons.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.96,0:13:03.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.03,0:13:04.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.35,0:13:05.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.97,0:13:10.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,便装日吗 探员们\N{\fnArial\fs30}It casual Friday, agents?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.62,0:13:12.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就在几英里外办案\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were on a case a few miles out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.37,0:13:13.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,接到个电话就过来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got a call to come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.79,0:13:15.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么你呢 来干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, how about you? What's your business?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.73,0:13:17.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯勒文医生是我的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, dr. Silver's a friend of mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.45,0:13:18.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,听说他今天没上班\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heard he didn't show up for work today,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.88,0:13:20.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以来看看他是不是病了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I thought I'd stop by and see if he's sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.53,0:13:21.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,没病 失踪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not sick. Missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.92,0:13:24.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,失踪 谁说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Missing? Says who?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.29,0:13:27.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说的 空房子 没打包行李\N{\fnArial\fs30}Says me … empty house, no bags packed,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.53,0:13:28.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,车还在门口\N{\fnArial\fs30}car still in the driveway.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.85,0:13:30.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们怎么知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, how'd you get on this?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.00,0:13:32.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,说来话长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, it's a long story.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.54,0:13:34.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟你说 你最好发布个全境通告\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell you what … why don't you put out an a.P.B.?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.74,0:13:37.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们回警局再交流 怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll compare notes down at the station. Sound good?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.18,0:13:38.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.85,0:13:40.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 当然 - 感谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sure. - Obliged.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.89,0:13:44.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,好一个金蝉脱壳啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow, talk about talking out of your butt.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.06,0:13:46.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶紧吧 你个小白痴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Just hurry, you idjit.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.19,0:14:05.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个失踪的医生和一个烂掉的病人\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we got a missing doctor and an oozy patient, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.51,0:14:06.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,扑朔迷离啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Plot thickens.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.97,0:14:08.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,咱们去看看艾德的室友有什么要说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, let's go see what Ed's roommates have to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.83,0:14:11.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾德·博莱斯有没有兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does Ed Bright have a brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.28,0:14:12.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,没 怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.55,0:14:15.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么那个就不是他双胞胎兄弟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then that's not his twin.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.68,0:14:19.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么 变形怪么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what … shifter?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.32,0:14:20.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what we're looking at.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.82,0:14:22.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 迪恩和我进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, Dean and me are gonna go in.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.48,0:14:23.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你俩呆在这里看门\N{\fnArial\fs30}You two stay here and watch the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.81,0:14:25.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,有东西跑出来 就开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something comes out, shoot it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.09,0:14:26.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,最好用银子弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, best guess … silver bullets.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.57,0:14:29.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不太会用火器\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm fairly unpracticed with firearms.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.78,0:14:32.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道什么人才嗷嗷的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know who whines?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.90,0:14:34.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,小宝宝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Babies.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.28,0:15:06.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么都别碰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Don't touch anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.97,0:15:09.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hey, back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.15,0:15:11.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.92,0:15:13.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我们 怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Talk to us. What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.27,0:15:14.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ed?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.91,0:15:16.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 艾德 发生了什么 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ed, what's going on? - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.36,0:15:18.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是艾德\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not Ed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.43,0:15:26.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's wrong with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.53,0:15:27.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么 你很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, nothing. You're okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.81,0:15:29.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事 我们会帮你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're okay, all right? We're gonna get you help.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.77,0:15:31.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有些问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me ask you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.57,0:15:32.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do I …
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.22,0:15:34.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do all of us …
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.60,0:15:36.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,是不是都变成艾德了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do we look like Ed?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.17,0:15:37.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.21,0:15:38.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 当然没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, no, no, no, of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.69,0:15:40.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你发烧了 产生幻觉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You, uh … you have a fever. You're hallucinating.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.93,0:15:43.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,马歇尔 到底怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marshall, Marshall, hey, what happened here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.07,0:15:44.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要死了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I gonna die?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.81,0:15:46.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你不会死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. You're not gonna die, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.17,0:15:48.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,快告诉我们 这很重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, you need to talk to us. It's important.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.30,0:15:54.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾德感觉不舒服 所以我带他去看医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ed was feeling bad, so I took him to the doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.83,0:15:59.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我们现在都病了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think now we're all sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.95,0:16:01.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,还用你说\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.26,0:16:03.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,在你和艾德病之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}And before you got sick and before Ed got sick,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.68,0:16:05.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们有做过什么 去过哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you do anything? Did you go anywhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.60,0:16:07.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,集中精神\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, need you to focus for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.23,0:16:08.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.45,0:16:10.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,某个酒吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some bar.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.36,0:16:11.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,酒吧 什么酒吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}A bar? What bar?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.83,0:16:13.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像在八号街\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eighth street, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.28,0:16:13.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,八号街\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eighth street.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.98,0:16:15.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,酒吧里发生什么了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, and did anything happen at the bar?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.44,0:16:17.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到了什么 遇见了什么人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}D-did you see anything? Did you meet anyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.10,0:16:19.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,救护车马上就到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, an ambulance is on the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.63,0:16:21.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}A girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.81,0:16:24.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个女孩 然后呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}A girl? Okay. And?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.11,0:16:25.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,白衣女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}A girl in white.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.76,0:16:27.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.03,0:16:29.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,白衣女孩做了什么 马歇尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did the girl in white do, Marshall?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.54,0:16:31.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,她对艾德做过什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did she do to Ed?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.07,0:16:33.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,马歇尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marshall!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.66,0:16:40.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.08,0:16:41.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,一群无名小卒醒来发现成变形怪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, a bunch of regular joes wake up shifters?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.84,0:16:42.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,坑爹呢这是\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.95,0:16:44.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,变形怪一般是家族遗传\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shifters usually run in families.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.64,0:16:46.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这情况像是传染\N{\fnArial\fs30}This looks like an infection.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.21,0:16:48.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你俩没碰过什么吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody touched nothing?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.87,0:16:50.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚我要用滴露洗澡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm bathing in purell tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.91,0:16:52.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说他们遇见了一个女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, he said they met a girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.75,0:16:53.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定是夏娃\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's got to be eve.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.90,0:16:55.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,她为什么要这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}But why would she do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.22,0:16:57.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,怪物之母 生怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mommy monster. Make more.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.20,0:16:58.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 小卡问到点儿上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, no, Cass has got a good point.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.65,0:17:00.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果她要建一支变形怪军团\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, if she's gonna make a shifter army,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.11,0:17:03.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么要这种病到小命就快交代了的\N{\fnArial\fs30}why make one that's this sick, gooey, and dying?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.32,0:17:06.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,把这加到未解之谜全书里吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Add that to the pile of crap that don't make sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.23,0:17:07.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要去那酒吧吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, should we hit the bar?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.80,0:17:23.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,即便治安官是个二货\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, the sheriff's a mook, but still …
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.43,0:17:26.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,但应该会注意到这么多失踪人口吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'd think he'd notice this many missing folks.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.53,0:17:48.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里有个吸血鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got a vamp over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.83,0:17:55.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦不 是个死灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nope. Scratch that. We got a wraith.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.95,0:17:58.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.14,0:18:00.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么东西有尖牙还有手刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}What has teeth and a spike?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.77,0:18:02.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,这辈子没见过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never seen that in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.49,0:18:06.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,真好 夏娃开始搞杂交了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, great. So eve's making hybrids now?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.06,0:18:08.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来像 问题是为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like. The question is, why?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.69,0:18:10.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 她为什么想要\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, what does she want with a …
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.65,0:18:11.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,这玩意叫什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you call these?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.90,0:18:14.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,恭喜你 你发现的 自己想名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, congrats. You discovered it. You get to name it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.99,0:18:18.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰佛逊飞船（美国摇滚团体）\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jefferson starships.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.45,0:18:24.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为他们很恐怖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because they're horrible…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.68,0:18:26.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,并且很难干倒\N{\fnArial\fs30}And hard to kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.02,0:18:31.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来整个酒吧的人都被变成了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like the whole bar has been turned into the …
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.43,0:18:32.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰佛逊飞船\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jefferson starships.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.48,0:18:36.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 但为什么所有飞船仔都死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine. But why are all the…Starships dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.53,0:18:38.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,说不准 不过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't say, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.92,0:18:40.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们好像都烧起来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It looks like they all burned up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.58,0:18:41.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,烧起来 就像\N{\fnArial\fs30}Burned up? Like …
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.55,0:18:44.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像发高烧 得流感一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like a high fever, like the flu.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.64,0:18:46.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里到底是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.38,0:18:49.22,Title,0,0,0,0,,这里所有的怪物都染上莫他巴病毒（出自电影《恐怖地带》）了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does every monster in this town have the motaba virus?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.29,0:18:51.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,把手举起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hands where I can see them!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.60,0:18:58.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是一场误会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, this is not what it looks like.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.21,0:18:59.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是联邦探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, we're the feds.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.43,0:19:02.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗 联邦探员可不准干这些事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah? Well, feds are not allowed to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.98,0:19:05.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,拷上 转身\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cuff 'em. Turn around.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.89,0:19:29.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们能打个电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, if we can make a phone call,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.43,0:19:30.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,就能把一切解释清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}we can straighten this all out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.49,0:19:33.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,解释大屠杀 我倒想见识一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Straighten out a massacre? I'd like to see you try.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.44,0:19:37.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰佛逊飞船\N{\fnArial\fs30}J-jefferson starships!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.64,0:19:52.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.08,0:19:59.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'll say this …
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.23,0:20:02.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是我这一天看到的最完整的样品\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the healthiest-looking specimen I've seen all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.03,0:20:05.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我吃维他命\N{\fnArial\fs30}I take my vitamins.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.69,0:20:08.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能告诉我们到底怎么回事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you want to tell us what's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.51,0:20:15.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们是 夏娃的清洁工吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you boys are, uh, Eve's cleaning crew?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.15,0:20:16.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗 你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that it? You, uh …
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.84,0:20:19.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们来处理尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}you come around to clean up the bodies,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.22,0:20:21.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,确保秘密不会泄露 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}make sure the word doesn't get out, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.38,0:20:24.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你们抓走了医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that why you snatched up the doctor?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.38,0:20:27.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只是在浪费时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're so wasting your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.78,0:20:30.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这头蠢猪\N{\fnArial\fs30}You stupid head of cattle.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.93,0:20:34.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有飞船仔\N{\fnArial\fs30}More starships.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.41,0:20:36.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,呆在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.81,0:21:08.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们是斯勒文医生的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're Dr. Silver's boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.53,0:21:11.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心 我们放你们出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, don't worry. We're gonna get you out of here, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.95,0:21:13.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 钥匙 - 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Uh, uh, keys? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.00,0:21:16.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.58,0:21:18.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不会伤害你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}we're not gonna hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.09,0:21:20.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫萨姆 那是我哥 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name is Sam. And that's my brother, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.20,0:21:24.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些警察 他们不会回来了 永远不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those cops … they're not coming back, ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.36,0:21:32.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们叫什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are your names?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.45,0:21:35.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫乔 他是莱恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Joe. This is Ryan.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.99,0:21:38.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,莱恩你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hiya, Ryan. How you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.79,0:21:41.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,自从我们被抓之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}He won't talk,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.47,0:21:43.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就不肯说话了\N{\fnArial\fs30}not since they came for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.87,0:21:48.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 乔 我们会帮你们把\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, listen, Joe, we're gonna get you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.96,0:21:50.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,手铐解开\N{\fnArial\fs30}out of those handcuffs.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.90,0:21:54.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你也知道现在的状况 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you understand what's going on around here, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.89,0:21:56.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,首先 我们得确认你们是人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}So first we got to make sure you're you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.91,0:21:58.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们要怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}How you gonna do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.19,0:22:02.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要做一些 测试\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, there's a few, uh, dozen tests.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.74,0:22:07.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 开始吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, let's get started.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.95,0:22:13.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,这点手段就能让我开口吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Y-you really think that's gonna make me talk?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.48,0:22:15.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,总有办法治得了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something will.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.82,0:22:21.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到了两个饥肠辘辘的小孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got a couple of hungry human boys here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.49,0:22:23.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧 小子们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.40,0:22:30.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你俩从未听他们说起过\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you two never heard them talk…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.19,0:22:33.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么母亲 或者\N{\fnArial\fs30}about a mother or…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.75,0:22:36.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个叫夏娃的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}someone named Eve?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.26,0:22:39.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里只有我和莱恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was just me and Ryan in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.92,0:22:43.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的亲人呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And your folks?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.08,0:22:45.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,警察说下一个就是我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cops said we were next.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.21,0:22:49.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们说我们是食物\N{\fnArial\fs30}They said we were food.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.92,0:22:52.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还有其他家人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have any other family?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.52,0:22:53.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一个叔叔在梅利特\N{\fnArial\fs30}An uncle in Meritt.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.97,0:22:56.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,在哪里 镇外十五英里处吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meritt. What's that, like 15 miles outside of town?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.52,0:22:57.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 我们送你们过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, we'll get you there.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.91,0:23:00.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 方便说两句吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean. Can I have a word?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.00,0:23:06.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,眼下我们得找到夏娃\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to find Eve now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.18,0:23:07.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.54,0:23:09.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和萨姆就是去开个小差\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me and Sam just got to make a milk run.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.19,0:23:10.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我们需要你们的帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, we need your help here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.73,0:23:12.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你给我憋着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold your water.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.17,0:23:13.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们很快就回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll be back in a few.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.55,0:23:15.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.74,0:23:18.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,很多人的生命都危在旦夕 不只是他俩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Millions of lives are at stake here, not just two.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.99,0:23:20.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 专注一点 - 你开玩笑吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Stay focused. - Are you kidding?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.72,0:23:22.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有更重要的任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a greater purpose here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.16,0:23:22.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.79,0:23:24.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经厌倦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I'm getting a little sick and tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.46,0:23:27.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些更重要的任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}of the greater purposes, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.09,0:23:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在就想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think what I'd like to do right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.21,0:23:31.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,救那两个孩子 如果你不介意的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}is save a couple of kids, if you don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.63,0:23:35.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们马上就回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll catch up.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.03,0:23:37.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, guys, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.90,0:23:39.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.27,0:24:05.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该休息一会儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. You should get some rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.95,0:24:33.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不会去太久的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They won't take long.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.44,0:24:36.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,说不准\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.97,0:24:41.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们一路上可能会发现更多任性的孤儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}They may find more wayward orphans along the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.51,0:24:42.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,少傲娇了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, don't get cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.08,0:24:46.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.06,0:24:48.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,请原谅我用「讽刺」的方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pardon me for highlighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.50,0:24:51.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,来突显两兄弟危险又影响大局的\N{\fnArial\fs30}their crippling and dangerous empathetic response.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.66,0:24:53.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,同情行为\N{\fnArial\fs30}with "sarcasm."
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.60,0:25:02.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,不应该让他俩离开的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a bad idea, letting them go.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.06,0:25:03.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,乖啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.69,0:25:06.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,温家双煞不可能袖手旁观\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't let Sam and Dean Winchester do squat.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.57,0:25:09.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都是做该做的事 你知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They do what they got to. You know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.79,0:25:12.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,反正我们要想找到夏娃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway, we want Eve,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.12,0:25:14.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,首先得知道她在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}we need coordinates.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.92,0:25:17.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要么就在这里继续抱怨\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, we can stand here bellyaching,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.97,0:25:20.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,要么就去给那小子来个满清十大酷刑\N{\fnArial\fs30}or we can go poke that pig till he squeals.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.40,0:25:22.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,意下如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thoughts?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.61,0:26:05.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,她现在能看见你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, she can see you right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.47,0:26:08.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们却在惹她生气\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're just making her mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.55,0:26:12.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,让那个贱人来找我啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then tell the bitch to come get me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.24,0:26:14.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要单独和他呆五分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need five minutes alone with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.83,0:26:17.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What for?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.52,0:26:21.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.62,0:26:23.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的法力没有了\N{\fnArial\fs30}your batteries are dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.49,0:26:27.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我五分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me five minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.50,0:26:30.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.00,0:26:48.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,夏娃在巴克利街二十五号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eve's at 25 buckley street.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.91,0:26:53.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以打给萨姆和迪恩了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can call Sam and Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.87,0:27:08.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,酷刑审问哈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rigorous interrogation, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.55,0:27:12.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们知道她的位置了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we got a location.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.45,0:27:15.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我们只需要接近她 然后伺机下手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now we just got to get close enough to take a shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.42,0:27:18.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Well…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.18,0:27:20.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,每人一颗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's all take one.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.70,0:27:27.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,装上膛 要一枪一准\N{\fnArial\fs30}Load 'em up. Make 'em count.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.35,0:27:38.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我勒个去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to be kidding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.17,0:27:39.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,她一直在那里啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's been in there the whole time?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.43,0:27:42.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,她怎么会放我们进去啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why'd she ever let us in?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.92,0:27:44.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,还放我们出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or out.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.32,0:27:45.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一个办法能知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, there's one way to find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.81,0:27:47.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,就那么慢悠悠走进去么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, just stroll in?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.58,0:27:50.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都不知道哪些是人 哪个是她\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't know who's human or who's her.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.37,0:27:54.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个办法能把她引出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, there's one way to draw her out.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.69,0:27:56.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我和萨姆进去 - 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Me and Sam will go in. - Dean…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.36,0:27:59.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要是没机会开枪 那就得靠你们俩了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, we don't get a shot off, you two better.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.47,0:28:02.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这么蛮干啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.09,0:28:04.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 就这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Pretty much.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.59,0:28:14.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少还算简单明了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, at least it ain't complicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.84,0:28:31.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,咋整\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.96,0:28:35.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,不妙 不妙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crap. Crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.01,0:28:36.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,很不妙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.56,0:28:37.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,飞船仔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Starships?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.87,0:28:38.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.50,0:28:39.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个餐馆里就没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there anybody in this diner.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.76,0:28:42.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是食人妖魔的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}that is not a flesh-eating monster?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.57,0:28:43.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,有 咱哥俩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, me and you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.03,0:28:45.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 那我们快走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, well, let's get the hell out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.38,0:28:47.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好啊 - 两份特餐 是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Shall we? - Two specials, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.05,0:28:49.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不是我们点的 我们正要走呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, no, that's not for us. We were just heading out.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.19,0:28:51.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这么没礼貌 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, that would be rude, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.21,0:29:00.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜猜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.69,0:29:02.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是夏娃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eve.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.83,0:29:03.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,幸会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.77,0:29:07.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们干嘛不出去聊聊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't we step outside, chat?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.43,0:29:09.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,何必 这里没人打扰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why? This is private.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.73,0:29:34.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,凤凰灰烬 挺厉害啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Phoenix ash. I'm impressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.70,0:29:37.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们肯定费了很大事才找到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I bet you had to go a long way for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.47,0:29:39.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,可不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.69,0:29:41.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,把这些销毁 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Destroy these. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.69,0:29:44.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,放松点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.16,0:29:46.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是来打架的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not here to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.36,0:29:50.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 只是来集结全球所有妖魔鬼怪的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, just to rally every freak on the planet,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.07,0:29:53.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,带些个肉虫王 山寨蜘蛛人\N{\fnArial\fs30}bring in khan worms and… and half-assed spider-men.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.34,0:29:54.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有龙\N{\fnArial\fs30}and dragons.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.70,0:29:56.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,说真的 姑娘 还带龙来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really, sister? Dragons?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.00,0:30:00.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是搬出来一些老怪物 我需要帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, I dusted off some of the old classics. I needed help.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.15,0:30:01.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮你干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}With what?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.14,0:30:03.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,毁掉这个星球吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tearing apart the planet?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.01,0:30:09.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们误解我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You misunderstand me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.97,0:30:11.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从没想要那样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never wanted that,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.01,0:30:13.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,一开始没想\N{\fnArial\fs30}not at first.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.97,0:30:15.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢我们的协议\N{\fnArial\fs30}I liked our arrangement.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.28,0:30:17.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么协议\N{\fnArial\fs30}What arrangement?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.58,0:30:19.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,自然界的秩序\N{\fnArial\fs30}The natural order.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.30,0:30:21.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的孩儿们转化一些人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}My children turned a few of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.87,0:30:24.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们去猎杀一些我的孩儿 我挺高兴的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hunted a few of them. I was happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.71,0:30:26.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊 那什么变了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. So what changed?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.75,0:30:29.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的孩儿们 都是你们俩害得\N{\fnArial\fs30}My children, no thanks to you,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.95,0:30:32.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始被人绑架 被折磨\N{\fnArial\fs30}started getting kidnapped and tortured,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.73,0:30:34.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,甚至我的长子们\N{\fnArial\fs30}even my firstborns.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.06,0:30:36.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我被逼卷入此事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was pushed into this.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.91,0:30:39.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,毕竟 妈妈总会保护她的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}After all, a mother defends her children.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.51,0:30:40.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.78,0:30:43.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,要用「年度最佳妈妈」来为自己辩护吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna use the "Mother of the year" defense?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.10,0:30:44.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,就你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.95,0:30:46.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,碰巧是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It happens to be true.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.04,0:30:49.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.87,0:30:51.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我变成这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you'll believe it if I look.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.58,0:30:53.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们就会相信我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}a little more like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.11,0:31:00.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你个贱货\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.82,0:31:03.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,她为了保护你们而牺牲 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}She died to protect you, didn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.46,0:31:05.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,看见没\N{\fnArial\fs30}See?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.61,0:31:07.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们也明白母爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}You understand a mother's love.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.47,0:31:08.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我也一样 - 好吧 你给老子听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm no different. - All right, you know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.80,0:31:10.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,谈话到此结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}This conversation's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.28,0:31:11.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果要杀我们 就请动手\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you're gonna kill us, kill us.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.95,0:31:13.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.86,0:31:14.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.04,0:31:17.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只想要克劳力的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Crowley I want dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.39,0:31:19.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你下手太慢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you're too late there.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.34,0:31:22.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个英国佬几个月前已经死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That little limey mook roasted months ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.50,0:31:26.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,克劳力还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crowley's alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.28,0:31:28.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.66,0:31:31.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从每个被他折磨的孩子眼中\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see his face through the eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.28,0:31:34.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到了他的脸\N{\fnArial\fs30}of every child he strings up and skins.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.79,0:31:38.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道他为什么要伤害我的孩子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any idea why he's hurting my babies?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.91,0:31:40.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,他想要炼狱 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wants purgatory, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.77,0:31:42.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,位置神马的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Location, location, location.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.32,0:31:44.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是那么跟你们说的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that what he told you?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.34,0:31:48.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,是为了灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's about the souls.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.64,0:31:49.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,灵魂怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, what about them?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.28,0:31:52.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们是力量 你个纯洁的小笨蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're power, you simple little monkey.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.65,0:31:54.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,是燃料\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuel.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.24,0:31:58.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,每一个灵魂都是最好的核反应堆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Each soul a beautiful, little nuclear reactor.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.92,0:32:01.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,收集起来 你就拥有了太阳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put them together, you have the sun.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.95,0:32:04.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,想想 地狱之王拥有了这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, think what the king of hell could do.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.04,0:32:07.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,未开发的巨大油井 他会做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}with that vast, untapped oil well…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.61,0:32:10.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会变得多么强大\N{\fnArial\fs30}How powerful he'd be.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.18,0:32:14.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,克劳力现在想偷走我的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now Crowley wants to siphon off my supply.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.60,0:32:17.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,折磨我的孩子帮他达到目的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and torture my children to do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.98,0:32:20.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 老虎不发威当我病猫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, fine. I'll quit playing nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.24,0:32:23.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就转化所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll turn you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.25,0:32:26.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,每一个灵魂 归我所有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every soul … mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.14,0:32:28.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,当所有灵魂都归我的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's see how hot his hell burns.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.39,0:32:30.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们看看他还能得意到几时\N{\fnArial\fs30}when everyone comes to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.79,0:32:33.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是他自找的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He asked for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.81,0:32:37.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,据我所知 地球上也有个几十亿人吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, last I checked, there are a few billion of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.75,0:32:39.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的计划需要费些时日\N{\fnArial\fs30}That plan might take a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.50,0:32:41.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认为我来这里做什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What exactly do you think I'm doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.58,0:32:45.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在打造完美的怪兽\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm building the perfect beast.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.99,0:32:48.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.54,0:32:49.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}All those …
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.81,0:32:53.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们发现的这些东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}all those things we've been finding.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.11,0:32:55.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,这叫做内测\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call it beta testing.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.72,0:33:00.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得你的配方有点不对啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I think your formula might be a little off.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.65,0:33:02.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们到处自相残杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're imploding all over town.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.47,0:33:05.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,是有一些次品\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ohh, there were a few unfortunate failures.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.18,0:33:07.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我终于成功了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I eventually got it right.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.52,0:33:12.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,安静 聪明 不易察觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quiet, smart, inconspicuous.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.33,0:33:14.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,一天之内就可以遍布整个小镇\N{\fnArial\fs30}It can spread through a whole town in under a day.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.65,0:33:16.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,最精彩的地方是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, and the best part …
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.92,0:33:18.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一直都在你们身边\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've been with it the whole time.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.71,0:33:21.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.24,0:33:23.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 你们就是他的最终关卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, you were the final test.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.94,0:33:24.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当然要确定他能否\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had to see if it could.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.89,0:33:27.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,神不知鬼不觉逃过猎魔人的眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}slip past hunters undetected, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.97,0:33:31.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,是小莱恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Little Ryan.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.54,0:33:44.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Joe?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.72,0:33:52.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,莱恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ryan?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.97,0:34:15.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们貌似不开心\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look upset.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.89,0:34:18.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,说句让你们舒心的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it makes you feel any better,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.51,0:34:21.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,莱恩注定能骗的过你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ryan was bound to work on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.94,0:34:23.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,任性的小孤儿…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Little wayward orphan…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.24,0:34:25.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像你们一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.52,0:34:28.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们现在已经无能为力了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nothing you can do about it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.26,0:34:30.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以还是谈谈吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So let's talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.59,0:34:31.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么好谈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.70,0:34:33.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么说可不对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's where you're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.40,0:34:37.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有一个提议\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have an offer to propose.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.52,0:34:39.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,克劳力…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crowley…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.26,0:34:42.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,踪迹难觅 这你们都知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}As you know, not so easy to find.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.47,0:34:44.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以不如这样…\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, here's the deal…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.06,0:34:46.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们去找到他…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You find him…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.09,0:34:48.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他带来见我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring him to me…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.35,0:34:51.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就饶你们一命\N{\fnArial\fs30}I let you live.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.37,0:34:55.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,免了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.12,0:34:57.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 迪恩 - 萨姆 不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dean… - Sam, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.07,0:34:58.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,答案是不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}The answer is no.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.81,0:35:01.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,说得好像你还有别的选择似的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You say that like you have another option.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.76,0:35:03.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许有 也许没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe I do, maybe I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.28,0:35:04.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,是嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.44,0:35:14.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我就彻底断了你们的念想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, so much for your plan "B".
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.33,0:35:21.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定在想「我为什么会如此软弱」\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you, wondering, "Why so flaccid?"
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.33,0:35:22.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡西迪奥 我比你年长\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm older than you, Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.84,0:35:24.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道天使的死穴\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what makes angels tick.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.29,0:35:28.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要我在 你就把自己当做\N{\fnArial\fs30}As long as I'm around, consider yourself…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.20,0:35:30.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,废物吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}unplugged.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.65,0:35:34.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,为我卖命吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Work for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.57,0:35:37.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,条件很优厚呦\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a good deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.82,0:35:42.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,追加福利 饶你们的朋友也不死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bonus… I won't kill your friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.54,0:35:43.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, look,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.11,0:35:48.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,过去几个月里 我们一直在为个恶棍卖命\N{\fnArial\fs30}The last few months, we've been working for an evil dick.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.28,0:35:51.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可不想改为投靠一个巫婆\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not about to sign up for an evil bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.06,0:35:53.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不会与恶魔合作\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't work with demons.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.09,0:35:55.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不会与怪物合作\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't work with monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.19,0:35:58.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你会因此杀了我们 尽管动手吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if that means you got to kill us, then kill us!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.61,0:35:59.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.09,0:36:01.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以转化你们…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I turn you…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.80,0:36:04.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,到时你们就任我摆布了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you do what I want anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.28,0:36:09.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,打死我都不会同意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beat me with a wire hanger, answer's still no.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.88,0:36:18.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.65,0:36:19.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,逼我\N{\fnArial\fs30}test me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.60,0:36:23.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你咬我呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bite me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.61,0:36:27.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不要 - 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No! - Dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.72,0:36:35.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,凤凰灰烬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Phoenix ash.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.85,0:36:38.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,一颗子弹…\N{\fnArial\fs30}One shell…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.68,0:36:40.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,加一盎司威士忌…\N{\fnArial\fs30}One ounce of whiskey…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.38,0:36:41.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,一饮而尽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Down the hatch.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.92,0:36:45.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,之后会散发点腐气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Little musty on the afterburn.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.92,0:36:48.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见了 妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call you later, mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.12,0:37:19.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut your eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.49,0:37:33.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,以后应该多带你参加猎魔行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got to take you on more monster hunts.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.17,0:37:36.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,小卡…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Cass, um…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.71,0:37:38.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩正血流不止\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean's bleeding pretty good.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.92,0:37:41.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得她把我转化成杰佛逊飞船了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think she turned me into a Jefferson starship.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.71,0:37:43.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能帮我一并恢复吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could you clear that up, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.54,0:37:49.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, we're good.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.40,0:37:51.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得赶紧走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got to go. Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.46,0:37:53.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,去哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.57,0:37:55.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}The kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.89,0:37:57.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个小孩 也是怪物之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}The little kid … he's one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.22,0:37:58.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,难以置信\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.98,0:38:00.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,小卡 我懂 你告诉过我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I know, Cass. You told me, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.65,0:38:02.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's just go.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.70,0:38:15.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们杀了那个巫婆 却还是让她得逞了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, we kill the wicked witch, and she still wins.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.24,0:38:17.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,目前为止他们可能已经转化了半个镇的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, they could have turned half the town by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.22,0:38:19.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,不许吐槽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't say it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.82,0:38:26.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到他们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Found them.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.94,0:38:35.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,又是谁把他们杀死的呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, who ganked them?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.94,0:38:42.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,是恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Demons.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.69,0:38:56.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么想\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.75,0:38:59.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为如果不是因为受了指使\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think that demons don't give a crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.65,0:39:03.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,恶魔才不会鸟什么怪物兄弟呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}about monster tweens unless they're told to.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.71,0:39:06.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你觉得她说的是实话吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you think she was telling the truth?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.64,0:39:09.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么实话\N{\fnArial\fs30}The truth about what?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.11,0:39:13.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说克劳力还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}She said that Crowley's still kicking.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.03,0:39:18.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我已经烧了他的遗骨 怎么…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I burned his bones. How c…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.09,0:39:21.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,她肯定吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was she certain?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.38,0:39:22.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,听上去很有把握\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounded pretty sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.09,0:39:24.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,据她所说\N{\fnArial\fs30}According to her,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.03,0:39:27.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,克劳力仍在某处残害着她的后裔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crowley's still waterboarding her kids somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.17,0:39:29.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我糊涂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.25,0:39:30.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,他可是个狡猾的王八蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, he's a crafty son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.58,0:39:34.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我是个天使 我马上就去调查此事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm an angel. I'll look into it immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.60,0:39:36.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.55,0:39:39.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,别忘了把调查结果告诉我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let us know what you find out!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.75,0:39:45.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了 怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.12,0:39:48.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,克劳力怎么可能逃脱了呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did Crowley get away?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.13,0:39:52.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,小卡不可能犯那样的错误\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, it's not like Cass to make mistakes like that,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.63,0:39:53.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非…\N{\fnArial\fs30}unless…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.91,0:39:56.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless what?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.25,0:39:57.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非他有意为之\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless he meant to.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.61,0:40:02.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比 你居然怀疑小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby, this is Cass we're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.72,0:40:04.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你相信吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you believe this?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.86,0:40:10.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.74,0:40:13.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,大概是我们想多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, it's probably nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.74,0:40:14.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.95,0:40:20.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说得对 大概是我们想多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what? You're right. It's… it's probably nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.46,0:40:50.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,小卡 说真的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really, Cass…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.53,0:40:53.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,事情越来越荒唐了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is getting ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.12,0:41:00.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还要为你擦屁股到什么时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many times am I gonna have to clean up your messes?
